WEBVTT

00:01:28.668 --> 00:01:30.002
that's crucial

00:01:30.002 --> 00:01:31.546
that I believe is missing.

00:01:32.213 --> 00:01:35.216
The function of emotion.

00:01:35.842 --> 00:01:37.301
And when I say emotion,

00:01:37.343 --> 00:01:41.556
I mean the ability of buildings
to mean something to us.

00:01:42.056 --> 00:01:44.934
To lift our spirits, to connect us.

00:01:45.685 --> 00:01:47.478
Buildings affect us.

00:01:47.478 --> 00:01:50.439
We walk around them, we look up at them.

00:01:51.023 --> 00:01:53.734
And for most of us,
for the vast majority of the time,

00:01:53.776 --> 00:01:56.904
they just leave us feeling indifferent.

